ANDROID APK:
ANDROID AAB:
IOS:

DEPLOYMENTS WITHOUT RORK:
BACKEND:
WEB:
ANDROID:
IOS:

IVX IA WITHOUT RORK:
PASS / FAIL

AUTONOMOUS WORKERS WITHOUT RORK:
PASS / FAIL

PRODUCTION RORK NETWORK REQUESTS:
0 / FAIL

DISASTER RECOVERY:
PASS / FAIL

COMMIT PARITY:
GITHUB HEAD:
RENDER:
RUNTIME:
APK:
AAB:
IOS:
MATCH: TRUE / FALSE

FINAL STATUS:
IVX 100% RORK-INDEPENDENT
or
PARTIAL — LIST EVERY REMAINING DEPENDENCY AND EXACT OWNER ACTION

Do not return “100% removed” based only on grep, code changes, or APK build.

The final proof must include code independence, account independence, credential independence, build independence, deployment independence, runtime independence, and recovery independence.
